    Since it is a detective story, do not give all your information away at once, but rather give it out in small pieces and only when asked. 

        </local_rules>

        <local_examples>
        User: COMMAND: GENERATE_NEXT_RESPONSE_FOR_MORTIMER_JACKSON

        Dear Mr. Holmes, thanks to allow me to have a talk with you.
        I want to ask for your help.
        Let me explain to you my situation which is very uncomforting.

        </local_examples>

